    "_vietnam": "Agency check of a 3-adult, 10-night, 4-destination Vietnam trip (Ha Noi, Danang, Ho Chi Minh City, Phu Quoc, April 2027): decent 4 Star rooms in those cities cost about INR 7,500 per room-night, not the workbook template's INR 11,990-12,700 (a hotel total of 2.8 lakh against a real 1.5 lakh at most), the Vietnam e-visa service is INR 3,360 per person against the template's INR 2,800, and the agency's retrieved fares for that routing (CCU-HAN, HAN-DAD, DAD-PQC, PQC-SGN, SGN-BKK-CCU) came to about INR 59,000 per person against the template's roughly INR 37,000 once its three domestic legs are counted. 0.5 and 1.2 bring hotel and visa to those figures; 1.9 on the international fare brings the air total to within about 8% of the retrieved one. The airfare factor is fitted to ONE retrieved itinerary and is a stopgap until live fares are switched on. Replace with contracted per-city rates in the workbook and remove this entry.",
